<!--
  Partial Info.plist for Sparkle update keys.

  This file is MERGED with the Xcode-generated Info.plist (GENERATE_INFOPLIST_FILE=YES);
  it holds only the custom Sparkle keys that build settings can't inject.

  SUFeedURL     — HTTPS URL of the hosted appcast.xml. Update this to wherever you host it
                  (GitHub Pages, S3, etc.). Must be https.
  SUPublicEDKey — EdDSA public key printed by Sparkle's `generate_keys`. The matching PRIVATE
                  key lives in the maintainer's login Keychain and signs every update ZIP
                  (via `sign_update`). Keep the private key backed up and off-repo.
  SUEnableAutomaticChecks — false so a live-performance build never prompts/downloads updates
                  on its own; operators check manually via Settings → "Check for updates".
-->
